g 2016–2018\"}]}, {\"v\": \"evaluation or monitoring\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"To evaluate progress toward HP2030 goals, CDC’s Foodborne Diseases Active Surveillance Network\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Bayesian negative binomial models were implemented to estimate changes in incidence\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"if the 95% credible interval (CrI) for the incidence rate ratio (IRR) did not include 1.0\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"A Bayesian, negative binomial model with penalized thin plate splines adjusting for state-specific trends was used to quantify adjusted incidence\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Unknown responses were included in proportion denominators.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}